<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pier 1 EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pier 1 EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it had raised its earnings per share estimates on Pier 1 Imports Inc to $1.04 from $1.02 for the fiscal year ending February 1997, and to $1.24 from $1.21 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- It cited better-than-expected results in December of more than 10 percent same-store sales growth. EVEREN had expected same-store sales growth of five to six percent.</p>
<p>-- Pier 1 was trading at 17-3/4, up 3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
